Hi Wuzzy!

A very big hat off to you! If I could, I would bake you a cake :)
I am honestly impressed that you imbibed all that vocabulary in just one=20
year!
I think it is a tremendous effort and shows great dedication to the=20
language.
I have been interested the language for about four years now and haven't=20
been getting anywhere.
So thanks for posting your progress and reminding everyone that with=20
dedication everything is possible.
Good luck and have fun using all your vocabulary! I would be interested how=
=20
your progress on reading is going.
I find the particles are about the most difficult, because there is so much=
=20
concept per letter.

Best wishes,
davjd

